Tests/Data Directory for the Midiname library
Chris Ahlstrom
2026-02-20 to 2026-03-27

This file describes the data associated with the test application.
The *.midnam files illustrate different flavors of XML hierarchies.

    Files from the /usr/share/ardour9/patchfile directory:

        Korg_Volca_Bass.midnam:

            UsesControlNameList Name="Controls"
            ControlNameList Name="Controls"
                Control Type="7bit" Number="5" Name="Slide Time" ...
            
        Kurzweil_SP88x.midnam:

            MasterDeviceNames
                CustomDeviceMode
                    ChannelNameSet
                        PatchBank
                            UsesPatchNameList
                    PatchNameList
                        Patch(es)

        Lexicon_DR_Music_FX_Expansion.midnam:

            ExtendingDeviceNames
                PatchNameList (2 of them)
                    Patch(es)

        Moog_MF_104M_Analog_Delay:

            ControlNameList
                Control
                    Values
                        ValueNameList
                            Value


        Roland_MT_32.midnam:

